			"widgets_values":[
				"SUBJECT — ARCHITECTURE, NEVER CHANGES:\nA young Asian woman, mid-20s. Oval face with SOFT ROUNDED CHEEKBONES.\nALMOND-SHAPED eyes, WARM BROWN irises. Eyebrows MEDIUM THICK, SOFT BROWN.\nDark brown hair, straight, MID-BACK length. CENTER PART, NEVER CHANGES.\nWearing a flowing white dress, fabric like FALLING WATER.\n\nSCENE — ONLY THIS CHANGES:\nStanding under a cherry blossom tree in full bloom.\nPetals falling like SNOW, swirling in the wind.\nLate afternoon golden light filtering through branches.\n\nMOVEMENT — THE VIDEO:\nShe turns her head SLOWLY, looking back over her shoulder.\nHair moves with the wind, strands catching the light.\nA single petal lands on her cheek, she smiles gently.\nEyes meet the camera with WARMTH and MELANCHOLY.\nThe moment stretches, time slows.\n\nSTYLE — UNIFIED AESTHETIC:\nCinematic, 35mm film, shallow depth of field,\ngolden hour lighting, slow motion, dreamlike atmosphere, 4k.\n\nPOSITIVE — DO THIS:\n- Gentle flowing motion\n- Soft natural lighting\n- Hair and fabric moving with wind\n- Slow graceful head turn\n- Warm melancholic expression\n- Petals falling naturally\n- Shallow depth of field\n- Film grain texture"
			],
